[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=23 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="出航前，供水站门口起了争执。一个船主说自家的过滤器已经报废，要求多领两桶；排在后面的人指着他船尾，说他还在拿淡水洗甲板。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="船主"

speaker_name=""

text="那是昨天下雨接的，你们凭什么看一眼就说我浪费？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你本来只想从旁边过去，却被人认出第五队的木牌，拉住要你评理。几个人一起说话，你能听见每一句，放在一起却什么也听不清。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="先等一下。让我先看两边说的是不是同一桶水。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我去找管供水的人。你不用因为拿着木牌就替整个港口作决定。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="管理员赶来时，船主已经把桶搬到面前。桶盖内侧有接雨水的网，底下确实沉着浮灰；过滤器的故障单却写的是三天前，和他刚说的昨天对不上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你为什么把日期说错？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="船主"

speaker_name=""

text="三天前我还能借邻船的用。昨天她们出航了。早说三天，你们就又要问我这几天喝的什么，拿了谁的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="后面那个指责他的人沉默了。管理员没有因此直接多发两桶，而是把船主的实际人数、剩余量和临时借用记录逐项对好，再看今天能调多少。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管理员"

speaker_name=""

text="我相信你急，但得按能核的数来。今天给一桶，另一桶等晚班补船到。临时滤芯可以先借，你拿回来登记，不能转手卖。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="船主"

speaker_name=""

text="万一晚班不到呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管理员"

speaker_name=""

text="不到就发预案通知。我们不把还没到的水先记成有，也不让你一直站在这里猜。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="争执没有突然变得和气。船主仍在小声抱怨，后面的人也没向他道歉。但队伍重新动起来，德雷顿帮着把水搬到不挡路的地方，你把故障单抄了份给维修班。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我刚才差点就说，先给他再说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="先给了，后面那个人今晚喝什么，你也得知道。不然你做完一件好事，就让别人去做后半件坏事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="可他很着急。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我也看见了。看见不等于只能选相信他或者骂他。你刚才问“是不是同一桶”，就挺有用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="船主回来取临时滤芯，经过时没看你，却把一只快散开的桶箍放在维修单旁，说是刚从仓库捡到的。你不知道那是不是一种道谢，也没追上去要求一个更好听的结尾。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="这份故障单先留港里。出航前要把今天的事交给还在这里的人，不然你带走的只是自己觉得做完了的部分。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把单子交到接班人手里，等她复述完地址才离开。码头上，别人把你们的绳解开；内街里，又有人接过刚才那一桶水。这里没有哪一件事能一直由同一双手做到底。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

